{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1000_p", "source_sha256": "239feaf0583ca3951a5f6a43b6f3d61e05f597d30b028360ba261c931fbca2fd", "ja": "（イベントも響たちのライブも大盛況に終わった。\n響は控え室にいなかったから、きっと……）", "zh": "（活动和响她们的演唱会都圆满结束了。响不在休息室里，所以一定是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1001_013hib", "source_sha256": "3d5f95eb78ed3a1bc898b7ce5dd8d84cda5d801c484e41a481bb5453b434955c", "ja": "ふう……。", "zh": "呼……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3095b30f464a3116211b0ec5c2a53440dd4c89a3f61d05f5bbaa5435b008e1b8", "ja": "響、お疲れさま。\nやっぱりここにいたんだな。", "zh": "响，辛苦了。果然在这里啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1003_013hib", "source_sha256": "58434289ee5b3fd85734936b1f65ebe42a2d2c848fe1c59455ed641cbaff170a", "ja": "あ、お疲れさま、{$P$}。\n……あれ？　ごめん、もう帰る時間！？", "zh": "啊，辛苦了，{$P$}。\n……咦？抱歉，已经到该回去的时间了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1004_p", "source_sha256": "1f796656ff59f814487ef7f54a2de4a18b5c7c6d1a9bcf467d373d2ad0779d80", "ja": "大丈夫だよ、もう少しゆっくりできる。\n挨拶回りとか、まだいろいろ終わってないんだ。", "zh": "没事的，还能再待一会儿。\n还要去跟各方打招呼之类的，手头还有好多事没忙完呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1005_013hib", "source_sha256": "7f12d1e2f66ccd42d9ac75c9fe65b4e0236bdeae58fe3f824233418ac89f976c", "ja": "そっか……。自分はね、ちょっと気持ちを整理して\nたんだ。今回のライブ、いろいろ考えちゃったから。", "zh": "这样啊……我刚才稍微整理了一下心情。因为这次的演唱会，让我想了很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4bbc265aeecf58909957bfaca737336af0f4bc3fb222a1ff5a97f75722229665", "ja": "トップアイドルをどうやって目指すか、とか？", "zh": "比如该怎么以顶尖偶像为目标？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1007_013hib", "source_sha256": "a4d024bffe0c2cafeb2b4c5814f74c4189dda72c5b3c6528dda7832c50e5cbd7", "ja": "うん……。でも、やっぱり自分は間違ってないって、\nあらためて思ってたところ。", "zh": "嗯……不过，我也刚刚再次觉得，\n自己的想法果然没有错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "63a83cc6cee0fb21fe6f9b8d8204588eae9f7337b5c6a6e7eca2db84e3737b3d", "ja": "だって本番のステージも、それまでのレッスンも、\n全部大変だったけど、すっごく楽しかったからね！", "zh": "因为正式演出的舞台也好，在那之前的练习也好，虽然全都很辛苦，但真的特别开心啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1009_013hib", "source_sha256": "a9cbe0240df5a0620d873401bf13471fe2f3961853a28236fa783c1c15e3e93d", "ja": "それって絶対、仲間と一緒だったからだし。\nだから自分たちは正しい！　絶対だぞ！", "zh": "那绝对是因为有伙伴们一起啊。所以我们是对的！绝对没错！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1010_p", "source_sha256": "0b6c5050a5443709868d03a755486498aeccc4ca77c5bf9561535fca478e83db", "ja": "はは、そうだな。楽しく頑張れるのが一番だ。\nパフォーマンス的にも満足できたか？", "zh": "哈哈，说得也是。能开心地努力才是最重要的。\n从表演效果来看，也算满意吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "e7edc1a2fc5b64566e36695a837ece1bdd1d489826c9c8fbc150f16841c7d721", "ja": "う……。それは、もうちょっとだったかな……？\nちゃんとできたけど、カンペキじゃなかったし……。", "zh": "唔……那个嘛，感觉还差了一点点吧……？\n虽然好好完成了，但还称不上完美……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1012_013hib", "source_sha256": "736ae7d7762df154ef734f1dfee6d6f4ed436f9d7d09271b6c0361f2cf689512", "ja": "あ、自分はカンペキだけどねっ。\nパフォーマンスが、ほんの、ほんのちょっとだけね！？", "zh": "啊，不过我可是完美的啦。\n只是表演还差那么、那么一点点而已！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1013_p", "source_sha256": "8b6158f93806925465fa93fe0ec5c8fede0396df97f4df8dfd0338667347772c", "ja": "わかってるって。じゃあ、また頑張ろうか。\n……みんなと一緒にな！", "zh": "我知道啦。那么，接下来也一起努力吧。\n……要和大家一起哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "fb9955c8fd830c317b882d1a6dd42c5de77193d9d54c961a72ff2769d89b32f0", "ja": "うんっ！　また明日から、みんなで特訓だぞっ！\n一緒に頑張って、励まし合って、競い合って。", "zh": "嗯！从明天开始，大家又要一起特训了！\n一起努力，互相鼓励，彼此竞争。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_013hib0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_013hib0553_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "bfc23f5228051a223a1904c99f26546c6d38615a34d9ff87ea91f6abb09cdbdb", "ja": "そして、自分たちはトップアイドルになるんだ！\nみんなで一緒にね！", "zh": "然后，我们要成为顶尖偶像！\n大家一起哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
